GRAMMAR.md §7.1: an invalid and a duplicate language code.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  languages: [en, EN, pt_br, en, fr.ca]
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1008]  project.canon:3:19
  invalid language code "EN"

error[E1008]  project.canon:3:23
  invalid language code "pt_br"

error[E1008]  project.canon:3:30
  language "en" listed twice

error[E1008]  project.canon:3:34
  invalid language code "fr.ca"

4 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
